{"q":"407","t":"Trapping Rain Water II","d":"Hard","p":false,"c":"<p>Given an <code>m x n</code> integer matrix <code>heightMap</code> representing the height of each unit cell in a 2D elevation map, return <em>the volume of water it can trap after raining</em>.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 1:</strong></p>\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"/assets/img/19a5ea976a7f43d0.jpg\" style=\"width: 361px; height: 321px;\" />\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> heightMap = [[1,4,3,1,3,2],[3,2,1,3,2,4],[2,3,3,2,3,1]]\n<strong>Output:</strong> 4\n<strong>Explanation:</strong> After the rain, water is trapped between the blocks.\nWe have two small ponds 1 and 3 units trapped.\nThe total volume of water trapped is 4.\n</pre>\n\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 2:</strong></p>\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"/assets/img/ba46c66eb315c1db.jpg\" style=\"width: 401px; height: 321px;\" />\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> heightMap = [[3,3,3,3,3],[3,2,2,2,3],[3,2,1,2,3],[3,2,2,2,3],[3,3,3,3,3]]\n<strong>Output:</strong> 10\n</pre>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><code>m == heightMap.length</code></li>\n\t<li><code>n == heightMap[i].length</code></li>\n\t<li><code>1 &lt;= m, n &lt;= 200</code></li>\n\t<li><code>0 &lt;= heightMap[i][j] &lt;= 2 * 10<sup>4</sup></code></li>\n</ul>\n","h":[],"m":"{\r\n  \"name\": \"trapRainWater\",\r\n  \"params\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"heightMap\",\r\n      \"type\": \"integer[][]\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"return\": {\r\n    \"type\": \"integer\"\r\n  }\r\n}","g":[{"name":"Array","slug":"array"},{"name":"Breadth-First Search","slug":"breadth-first-search"},{"name":"Heap (Priority Queue)","slug":"heap-priority-queue"},{"name":"Matrix","slug":"matrix"}],"s":[{"t":"Trapping Rain Water","s":"trapping-rain-water","d":"Hard","p":false},{"t":"Maximum Number of Points From Grid Queries","s":"maximum-number-of-points-from-grid-queries","d":"Hard","p":false}],"co":[["Amazon","amazon"],["Google","google"],["Meta","facebook"],["Microsoft","microsoft"],["Media.net","medianet"],["Bloomberg","bloomberg"],["Walmart Labs","walmart-labs"],["Samsung","samsung"],["Oracle","oracle"],["Flipkart","flipkart"],["X","twitter"]],"cs":{"a":[],"b":[["Microsoft","microsoft",2]],"m":[["Amazon","amazon",27],["Google","google",24],["Media.net","medianet",14],["Walmart Labs","walmart-labs",7],["Meta","facebook",6],["Bloomberg","bloomberg",4],["Flipkart","flipkart",3],["Otter.ai","otterai",3],["Oracle","oracle",2],["Samsung","samsung",2]]}}